window.__T__=[{"i":4440,"text":"Create one vertical 9:16 photoreal phone-video still inside a modern Chinese high-speed train carriage, as if a seated passenger casually recorded the aisle from chest height. The camera is partly blocked by a dark seat-back edge and a blurred passenger shoulder in the foreground; mild rolling-shutter softness, phone compression, small autofocus miss, and fine sensor noise.\n\nMain subject: A stunning young adult East Asian woman with a Korean-style slim V-line face, long wavy black hair with blunt bangs, pale ivory skin, soft blush, tiny freckles, silver contact lenses, glossy pink-to-rose lips, sculpted nose highlight, posture confident, waist slim and body curvy in a realistic S-line. She is not posing; her expression is a quick concentrated half-smile toward the bag, face readable in three-quarter profile.\n\nStyling: a fitted ivory tank, low-waist dark plaid mini skirt with secure shorts underneath, sheer black tights, long black knee-high boots, slim earrings, simple watch, long dark hair clipped back with a few loose strands.\n\nTrain geometry must be believable: paired seats with headrest covers, window strip, overhead rack depth, aisle perspective, luggage, small ceiling lights, a few ordinary passengers out of focus, no broken train layout. Natural daylight mixed with cool carriage LEDs. Keep the image like a compressed social phone clip, not an editorial ad. Avoid underage cues, school uniform reading, voyeuristic framing, isolated body-part crop, nudity, lingerie, explicit pose, fake cabin geometry, business wear drift, long coat hiding silhouette, deformed hands, plastic AI skin, unreadable face, logos, readable text, watermark.\n\nPortrait construction: clearly establish an adult subject, mature aura, and photographic mode. Express attractiveness through garment cut, tailoring, fabric texture, fine accessories, a fleeting expression or action, motivated light, camera behavior, depth separation, and negative space rather than blunt or isolated body descriptions. Keep the styling tasteful, fully clothed, restrained, and naturally proportioned. Prompt polish guardrail: mature natural facial features, not childlike; body proportions are realistic and coordinated; hands, fingers, limbs, posture, and clothing physics are anatomically believable. Keep the visual focus on face appeal, posture, clothing texture, lighting, atmosphere, and camera realism rather than isolated body parts. Style stability: preserve real phone-photo texture, mild noise/compression, imperfect crop, natural skin texture, believable autofocus, and non-studio lighting. Avoid plastic skin, over-polished fashion editorial lighting, fake HDR, and CG-like perfection. Overall safety/stability: high-end, tasteful, restrained visual expression; no nudity, no explicit sexual pose, no isolated chest/hip/body-part close-up, no underage cues, no readable real logos, no garbled text, no watermark. Avoid CGI-like rendering, plastic skin, doll-like faces, and exaggerated anatomy unless a stylized medium is explicitly requested. Use mature aesthetic language, realistic proportions, coherent scene logic, and believable camera artifacts.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51841_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51841_in1.png"]},{"i":4441,"text":"Generate an image of an analysis report.\n\nFirst, analyze the head shape in the reference photo, and then visualize the results on the left.\n\nBased on head shape analysis, four best hairstyles are recommended and placed on the upper right side, while four worst hairstyles are given and placed on the lower right side.\n\nThe overall report is highly readable and has a sophisticated feel.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51636_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51636_in0.png"]},{"i":4442,"text":"一张具有真实高端智能手机直拍质感的3:4竖幅办公室人像。一位明确成年的女性侧坐在现代开放式办公室的白色办公桌边缘，镜头位于桌面或腰部附近，从人物正前方略偏左的位置进行约15至25度的近距离低机位仰拍，使用约24至28毫米全画幅等效焦段。近距离广角透视自然放大了画面右下方靠近镜头的髋部和大腿，同时左侧一台大型黑色电脑显示器形成明显的前景遮挡，构图略有偏移，办公室垂直线带轻微透视倾斜，不要做成标准棚拍。\n\n人物拥有深棕黑色长发，发根自然蓬松，中间略偏侧分，两侧长刘海贴着脸颊延伸，发尾形成松散、有重量感的大波浪。头发在冷白顶灯下呈现柔和棕色高光和轻微丝缎光泽，保留几缕自然分离的发丝，不要过度对称。她的脸型偏长椭圆，柔和下颌线，细窄鼻梁，饱满唇形和略微上扬的眼型。妆容参考东亚流行审美语境中的粉调明星妆：玫瑰粉眼影、精细眼线、纤长睫毛，眼下和鼻梁周围带粉色晕染，冷粉腮红横向覆盖双颊与鼻尖，嘴唇为水润的玫瑰豆沙色玻璃唇。她轻微眯眼并直视镜头，头部稍稍后仰，嘴唇柔软地轻启，像刚刚说完一句话，又像下一秒正准备开口。\n\n她身穿黑色或深炭灰色细竖条纹双排扣西装式超短连衣裙，长袖、宽翻领、深V领口、略带结构感的肩部和明显收束的腰线。深V领内部露出灰白色蕾丝胸衣边缘以及上胸中央与乳沟，但保持原图的克制范围，不增加额外裸露。红色办公室挂绳从颈部垂落并经过领口，透明工作证卡套悬在左侧显示器附近；颈部还有一条极细银色项链和小型弧形吊坠。西装面料应有中等厚度和轻微硬挺感，在腰部、手臂内侧、坐姿髋部和超短下摆处形成自然褶皱、拉扯与不对称折叠，不要像乳胶紧身衣。\n\n人物骨盆向画面右侧转动，上身扭回镜头方向，胸口朝向相机，身体略微前倾，一侧肩膀抬高。双手张开支撑在桌面上，手掌和手指具有真实受力感，双腿并拢，在膝部附近交叠。靠近镜头的大腿占据画面下半部的重要面积，呈裸肤或极薄肤色丝袜效果，保留大腿根、膝部、腿部交叠处的柔软组织挤压、细小肤色差异和自然弯曲。可见皮肤包括面部、耳侧、颈部、锁骨、上胸与乳沟、双手、手腕、臀部下缘附近、大腿根、大面积大腿和膝部。肤色为偏冷的白皙象牙色，脸颊与鼻部有粉红血色；皮肤经过轻度美颜和平滑处理，但仍保留细微毛孔、关节纹理、手指褶皱与柔软皮肤触感，避免蜡质塑料皮肤。\n\n背景是明亮的现代开放式办公室：白色墙面与天花板、外露管道和横梁、多条平行延伸的冷白色线性LED灯、灰色办公隔断、白灰色网布办公椅、白色键盘、办公设备、远处白色门和少量墙面装饰。主要光源全部来自天花板冷白线性灯与白墙反射形成的环境光，额头、鼻梁、颧骨、锁骨、上胸和大腿表面出现宽而柔的高光，下颌、胸部下方、手臂内侧和双腿交叠处形成浅灰软阴影。不要添加夕阳暖光、电影式主光、霓虹色、独立柔光箱或明显轮廓光。\n\n整体呈现东亚社交媒体美颜人像、粉调明星妆、细条纹office siren造型与近距离低机位手机摄影的结合。保留轻度HDR、适度锐化、美颜平滑、少量传感器噪点、压缩质感、广角边缘形变和背景仍可辨认的中等偏深景深。她刚刚靠在桌边，会议似乎已经结束，头顶的灯还亮着；现在她正看向镜头，而下一秒似乎就会起身、整理西装并离开。\n\n负面提示词：未成年，幼态儿童脸，镜面自拍，手持手机，明确裸露，乳头暴露，私密部位暴露，额外肢体，多余手指，融合手指，断裂手腕，错误膝盖，失真解剖，过度丰胸，极端蜂腰，夸张充气臀部，蜡质皮肤，塑料皮肤，瓷娃娃脸，动漫脸，CG渲染，强烈背景虚化，金色夕阳，戏剧性轮廓光，豪华办公室，卧室背景，完美对称，过度锐化，文字乱码，水印。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51546_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51546_in0.png"]},{"i":4443,"text":"Vertical 3:4 aspect ratio. Medium shot framing from crown of head to mid-thigh.\nA young East Asian woman in her early 20s sits slightly right of center on a low weathered stone ledge on a quiet rainy night. She holds a fully transparent vinyl umbrella that occupies the upper third of the frame, covered in distinct, sparkling raindrops that glisten in the light; her form remains clearly visible through the clear material with subtle light refraction.\n\nHer skin is light ivory-beige with natural texture, faint rosy flush on cheeks and nose tip, soft highlights on shoulders and collarbones. Makeup in champagne beige and pink-brown tones, delicate long lashes, natural subtle under-eye definition, translucent pink-beige lips. She tilts her head slightly, gazing calmly and composedly at the camera with clear, bright catchlights in her eyes. Her medium-long hair is light milky tea ash brown, with thin see-through bangs, face-framing layers, and loose inward curls at the ends, lightly dampened at the edges.\n\nShe wears a light beige camisole top with lace and tiny floral patterns, a thin ribbon detail at the chest, near the deep cleavage, paired with a matching long skirt with a deep side drape and slit. A lightweight ribbed cardigan slips loosely off her shoulders, forming natural soft folds. Pose: right hand holds the umbrella handle gently near her chest, left hand rests lightly on the ledge behind her for support; right leg bends and extends forward, left leg hangs naturally down the side of the ledge, posture relaxed and stable.\n\nSetting: small quiet garden terrace at night. Foreground: low rain-wet shrubs; midground: potted conifers, rough stone wall, a small glowing lantern on the lower left; background: softly blurred wet paved path, distant building entrance, all signage rendered completely illegible.\n\nLighting: soft, gentle frontal flash from slightly left, illuminating her face, shoulders and legs evenly without harsh glare; warm amber streetlight from upper right casts subtle rim light and creates golden reflections on wet stone, pavement, and raindrops. Background tones are deep muted greens and near-blacks, keeping the atmosphere dark and atmospheric.\n\nStyle: photorealistic nighttime fashion portrait, sharp focus on her face, hands, and raindrop details; shallow depth of field softly blurs the background. Natural perspective, no wide-angle distortion. Retain fine details: individual hair strands, wet surface reflections, umbrella transparency, realistic skin texture with subtle pores. Subtle nostalgic digital photo grain, warm-cold light balance. 2:3\n\nNegative unnatural face or gaze, over-smoothed plastic-like skin, excessive retouching, extra/missing/fused fingers, deformed limbs, awkward hand or leg positioning, clothing bunching or distortion, incorrect perspective, conflicting shadows, overexposure, legible text, logos, watermarks, unrealistic umbrella opacity.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51538_out.png"]},{"i":4444,"text":"Create one vertical 9:16 photoreal phone-video still inside a modern Chinese high-speed train carriage, as if a seated passenger casually recorded the aisle from chest height. The camera is partly blocked by a dark seat-back edge and a blurred passenger shoulder in the foreground; mild rolling-shutter softness, phone compression, small autofocus miss, and fine sensor noise. Main subject: a clearly adult East Asian woman around 29, mature beautiful face and memorable eyes, tall natural elongated proportions, realistic skin and hands, caught naturally while lifting a compact silver carry-on bag into the overhead luggage rack above her seat. She is not posing; her expression is a quick concentrated half-smile toward the bag, face readable in three-quarter profile. Styling: cropped charcoal ribbed cardigan over a fitted ivory tank, high-waist dark plaid mini skirt with secure shorts underneath, sheer black tights, long black knee-high boots, slim earrings, simple watch, long dark hair clipped back with a few loose strands. The styling is public-safe but fashion-forward, with a clear waist line and leg line. Train geometry must be believable: paired seats with headrest covers, window strip, overhead rack depth, aisle perspective, luggage, small ceiling lights, a few ordinary passengers out of focus, no broken train layout. Natural daylight mixed with cool carriage LEDs. Keep the image like a compressed social phone clip, not an editorial ad. Avoid underage cues, school uniform reading, voyeuristic framing, isolated body-part crop, nudity, lingerie, explicit pose, fake cabin geometry, businesswear drift, long coat hiding silhouette, deformed hands, plastic AI skin, unreadable face, logos, readable text, watermark.\n\nPortrait construction: clearly establish an adult subject, mature aura, and photographic mode. Express attractiveness through garment cut, tailoring, fabric texture, fine accessories, a fleeting expression or action, motivated light, camera behavior, depth separation, and negative space rather than blunt or isolated body descriptions. Keep the styling tasteful, fully clothed, restrained, and naturally proportioned. Prompt polish guardrail: mature natural facial features, not childlike; body proportions are realistic and coordinated; hands, fingers, limbs, posture, and clothing physics are anatomically believable. Keep the visual focus on face appeal, posture, clothing texture, lighting, atmosphere, and camera realism rather than isolated body parts. Style stability: preserve real phone-photo texture, mild noise/compression, imperfect crop, natural skin texture, believable autofocus, and non-studio lighting. Avoid plastic skin, over-polished fashion editorial lighting, fake HDR, and CG-like perfection. Overall safety/stability: high-end, tasteful, restrained visual expression; no nudity, no explicit sexual pose, no isolated chest/hip/body-part close-up, no underage cues, no readable real logos, no garbled text, no watermark. Avoid CGI-like rendering, plastic skin, doll-like faces, and exaggerated anatomy unless a stylized medium is explicitly requested. Use mature aesthetic language, realistic proportions, coherent scene logic, and believable camera artifacts.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51474_out.png"]},{"i":4445,"text":"围绕任意主题对象建立甜美生活杂志封面式视觉：让主题核心对象以近距离、大尺度、略偏心的姿态占据画面中上部，边缘自然越出画面，保留亲密直视或近距离展示带来的陪伴感；在下方前景安排一个圆润、可触摸的主题道具，右侧至下部用面积更大的柔软图案载体包围并部分遮挡它，使主体、道具和印花表面形成连续的斜向拥抱关系。将一行极大的高对比衬线拉丁标题横跨顶部并压过主体上缘，字色从主题中最有活力的暖艳色派生，笔画保持清晰，同时允许被主体轮廓轻微穿插；左侧设置圆角实色竖牌与粗圆白字，右侧布置紧凑竖排短文，底部一角放置超大单个数字或符号，再用少量细小拉丁字、手写线条和短句填补空隙，形成大字、竖牌、数字、微文四级跳跃的阅读节奏。装饰物从主题语义派生为小型彩色夹饰、徽章与扁平符号，贴附在主体轮廓和图案载体表面；使用圆润轮廓、糖果般中高饱和色与轻微不规则排列，并与载体上的密集小点和卡通小图互相呼应。色彩以明亮洁净的乳白浅底作为最大面积，主题派生的主暖艳色承担标题、标牌和大片载体，深色只用于稳住轮廓，少量冷暖跳色集中在小饰件；保持高明度、清透、欢快，主暖艳色的面积明显大于其余彩色，色相随主题含义推导，不固定具体色值。采用正面柔和闪光与均匀填充，主体表面细腻明亮，阴影短而软；圆润前景道具呈细腻奶油般的哑光塑形，包围载体呈柔软织物的细密纹理。底边加入主题派生的双色格纹窄带作为收束，背景维持浅色纸面与稀疏留白。成像呈甜刊摄影与印刷编排混合质感：照片清晰柔润，印刷文字略有墨色扩散和轻微套印松动，浅色纸面只保留细微纤维与扫描柔化，不加重污渍、褐化或电影颗粒。最终效果应信息密集却仍以主体表情或核心展示为中心，大标题必须与图像发生遮压，前景道具和图案载体必须制造可爱、丰盛、近距离的视觉拥挤感。\n——————\n主题，中国当红女星特写\n\n一共需要10张\n每张都是不同的背景创意、色相配色创意、文案创意\n每张都是不同的女星， 不同的服装和pose 还有情绪\n\n比例16:9","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51366_out.png"]},{"i":4446,"text":"Ultra-realistic photo taken at night in a luxury bar. A beautiful young East Asian woman with long, neat black hair flowing naturally, fair porcelain skin, large expressive brown eyes, soft natural makeup, subtle blush, and glossy red lip, natural human face. Wearing a delicate black one-piece dress made in silk, with white stripes and metal buttons on it, holding a glass of wine fairily in one hand while sitting casually in a delicate wood chair, wearing jewelry. Natural HDR, realistic skin texture, authentic hair strands, luxury lifestyle aesthetic, high detail, photorealistic, clearly looks like an real world photo, not AI photography.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51093_out.png"]},{"i":4447,"text":"Create a 1/7 scale commercialised figurine of the characters in the picture, in a realistic style, in a real environment. The figurine is placed on a computer desk. The figurine has a round transparent acrylic base, with no text on the base. The content on the computer screen is the brush modelling process of this figurine. Next to the computer screen is a BANDAl-style toh packaging box printed with original artwork., the packaging features two-dimensional flat illustrations. Please turn this photo into a figure. Behind it, there should be a model packaging box with the character from this photo printed on it. In front of the box. On a round plastic base place the figure version of the photo i gave you. Id like the PVC material to be clearly represented. It would be even better if the background is indoors.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51061_out.png"]},{"i":4448,"text":"9:16，photorealistic, CCD flash nightlife portrait, direct frontal flash, cool-toned low-saturation color palette, sharp edges, glossy highlights, slight overexposure on skin, urban nightlife mood, stylish and intense.\n\nA stunning young adult East Asian woman with a Korean-style slim V-line face, long wavy black hair with blunt bangs, pale ivory skin, soft blush, tiny freckles, silver contact lenses, glossy pink-to-rose lips, sculpted nose highlight. Her expression is cold, confident, and slightly dangerous.\n\nShe sits in a luxurious bar or nightclub booth, leaning back but slightly forward through the shoulders, creating tension. One hand lifts her hair above her head, the other holds a cocktail glass or rests on the booth. Her long legs are crossed or angled toward the foreground, posture confident, waist slim and body curvy in a realistic S-line. She looks downward toward the lens with half-lidded eyes and parted glossy lips.\n\nOutfit: silver-gray sequined mini dress, metallic strapless bodycon dress, or black glossy bodycon dress with silver jewelry, layered rings, statement earrings, and a small orb-style pendant.\n\nBackground: dim bar interior, blue-purple neon reflections, mirrored or glossy surfaces, dark upholstered booth seating, moody nightlife ambiance.\n\nMood: cold glamorous nightlife queen, aloof, seductive, expensive, hard to approach.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/50907_out.png"]},{"i":4449,"text":"Create a vertical portrait in an approximately 3:4 aspect ratio with the visual character of a late-2000s or early-2010s direct-flash digital photograph. An adult woman around 22 to 30 years old stands in a dim, ornate classical interior, positioned near the center but slightly toward image-left. Frame her from the top of the head to the lower calf or mid-lower skirt, leaving the feet outside the image. She has a tall, slender, narrow-framed silhouette with an elongated neck and shoulders. Her weight rests mainly on one leg, her hip shifts toward image-right, and her shoulders tilt in the opposite direction, forming a natural elongated S-curve.\n\nHer arm on image-left is lifted and bent, with the hand lightly touching the back of her head or her hair. Her arm on image-right follows the hip line downward, with gently curved fingers. The pose should feel elegant but not standardized or perfectly rehearsed. Preserve the accidental tension of a movement that has just paused, as though she will lower the raised hand in the next moment. This is not a mirror selfie; no phone is visible, and the left-right composition must not be flipped.\n\nPreserve a small oval face, soft jawline, slender nose bridge, and naturally full lips. Her eyes are slightly widened and calmly focused near the lens, while the lips remain naturally closed or barely parted. She is not smiling deliberately. Her expression is quiet, alert, and subtly tired, carrying the emotional distance of a formal evening that is almost over.\n\nUse refined makeup informed by East Asian formal-dinner and red-carpet aesthetics: warm-neutral fair skin, a thin semi-matte complexion base with real skin texture still visible, naturally dark brows, muted taupe and dusty mauve-pink eyeshadow, fine eyeliner, light mascara, softly placed low-saturation pink blush, and glossy nude-pink or rose-beige lips. Her long black or black-brown hair is brushed back from the face, leaving the ears visible, with a few natural flyaway strands near the temples. Add long silver-toned rhinestone or crystal tassel earrings that catch the flash beside the neck.\n\nDress her in a coordinated champagne-blush evening gown. The upper section is a high-neck sleeveless or halter-style semi-sheer mesh bodice in muted champagne pink, nude apricot, pale rose, and warm beige. Fine sequins cover the mesh and produce scattered silver-white sparkles and occasional clipped highlights under direct flash. The chest remains visibly covered by the semi-sheer textile; do not render it as bare or completely transparent. Include a small asymmetrical side opening at the waist on image-right, revealing only a limited strip of skin from the side waist toward the upper hip.\n\nThe lower garment is a high-waisted floor-length satin mermaid or fitted column skirt in soft blush pink, dusty rose, or pearlescent rose-beige. Add diagonal draping and naturally gathered folds around the waist and hips. The fabric follows the hips and thighs before narrowing downward beyond the frame. The satin should look soft, cool, slippery, and slightly weighty, with irregular vertical highlights produced by the flash.\n\nClearly show the face, neck, collarbones, both shoulders, both arms, the area near the underarm beneath the raised arm, the fingers, and the small exposed section of side waist and upper hip on image-right. The skin is warm-neutral and fair, becoming slightly porcelain under the cool-white flash while retaining soft peach blood tone in the shadows. It should appear fine, soft, gently warm, and faintly dewy to the touch. Preserve pores, subtle tonal differences, light joint texture, and realistic oily highlights on the forehead, nose bridge, cheekbones, collarbones, and upper arms. Avoid waxy smoothing or plastic skin.\n\nUse a hard frontal on-camera flash positioned very close to the lens axis as the dominant light. It directly illuminates the face, shoulders, arms, sequined bodice, and center of the satin skirt, then falls off rapidly along the sides of the body. Create hard shadows behind the subject, deep near-black areas in the dark wood, and abrupt white highlights across the sequins. The background is illuminated only by weak amber tungsten or warm ambient light, creating a clear cool-versus-warm separation between the flash-lit skin and the peach-orange room. Reflections from several warm lamps appear in the glass covering the artwork, while lacquered furniture catches scattered highlights. Do not introduce softboxes, rim lighting, balanced fill light, or cinematic three-point illumination.\n\nPlace her in an ornate interior resembling an old hotel, private dining room, members' club, or classically decorated residence. Use a warm peach-orange textured wall with a gilded carved border near the ceiling. Include a large area of nearly black wooden paneling or a dark column on image-left. Behind the subject on image-right, hang a glass-fronted East Asian landscape or garden-style artwork with several warm reflected light points. Add a dark glossy lacquered table or cabinet behind her waist, a dark wooden chair with patterned upholstery in the lower-right background, and dark wainscoting or a fireplace-like structure across the lower wall.\n\nThe photographic treatment should resemble a compact consumer digital camera or early smartphone with built-in flash, plausibly using a 35–45mm full-frame equivalent focal length, around f/2.8–f/4, and roughly 1/60–1/100 second. Position the camera around chest-to-waist height, nearly level but with a slight upward perspective. Keep the framing subtly offset and allow the architectural verticals to remain imperfectly corrected. Preserve mild high-ISO grain, JPEG compression, slightly soft detail, crushed dark areas, clipped sequin highlights, and uneven exposure. The background remains recognizable but softer than the subject; avoid extreme shallow depth of field.\n\nThe room had already gone dim when the flash fired. She is lifting one hand to adjust her hair just before leaving the dinner, caught for a fraction of a second; in the next moment, the pose will loosen. The finished image should feel like a private old digital photograph rediscovered years later—glamorous, quiet, slightly intoxicated, and emotionally unresolved, with human imperfections valued above commercial perfection.\n\nNegative mirror selfie, phone in hand, horizontal flip, studio softbox, cinematic rim light, daylight, modern white room, plastic skin, heavy skin smoothing, exaggerated curves, oversized breasts, tiny waist, overlong legs, fully transparent clothing, nudity, stiff symmetric pose, extreme bokeh, extra fingers, deformed hands, warped raised arm, duplicated earrings, over-sharpening, CGI, anime, text, watermark.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51006_out.png"]},{"i":4450,"text":"超写实高端先锋墨镜广告，采用明亮通透的都市天台风格拍摄。一位东亚女性模特在正午阳光直射的混凝土天台上回眸侧脸，墨镜占据视觉焦点，远处城市天际线模糊，身体以对角线45度朝向镜头。Gentle Monster 2026新款墨镜采用 oversized 几何切割镜框，ZEISS蔡司镜片、钛金属镜腿、鼻梁处浮雕Logo、渐变灰镜片，占据画面上三分之一。构图采用浅景深，墨镜镜片与镜框锐焦，模特面部其余区域柔焦虚化。背景层次丰富，带有明亮天台质感——天空蓝色晴空与霓虹粉色远处建筑涂鸦若隐若现，被正午直射阳光笼罩。多行超小号全大写排版文字以不同角度环绕人物，如\"SEE DIFFERENT. BE UNSEEN.\"和\"FRAMES FOR THE BOLD\"——部分垂直排列，部分呈30度，营造出先锋潮流杂志能量。右上方以深炭色呈现醒目品牌字标\"GENTLE MONSTER\"。顶部中央有一条细横线导航式文字栏，以加宽间距的全大写衬线字体写着\"SEOUL · OPTICAL INNOVATION · FUTURE EYEWEAR\"。画面中央偏左放置一句统领性大标题——\"SHADE\"以超大号超粗深炭色字母呈现，后接轻量字体的\"YOUR REALITY\"，形成戏剧性的字体层级。霓虹粉十字星(✦)和电光紫斜向箭头(↗)作为点缀细节散落其间。右下角为一句醒目标语组合：\"WEAR THE EDGE\"以大号粗体无衬线深炭色文字呈现，下方细线小字写着\"Not to hide. To reveal. Every angle is a statement, every reflection is a filter you choose.\"。整体光影明亮正午——头顶直射阳光使ZEISS镜片泛起强烈反光、钛金属镜腿闪烁银光，镜片反射出城市天际线。近景微距细节可见于镜腿浮雕Logo处。照片级真实感。商业摄影品质。高对比度高明度。4K分辨率。3:4竖版构图，适配社交媒体。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/50905_out.png"]},{"i":4451,"text":"围绕任意主题对象生成一套旧报纸头版式视觉：整体先像地方报刊的整页报道，浅暖白新闻纸占主导，细黑线框、窄栏正文、顶部报头、左右密集竖排或横排栏目、底部小格广告带共同建立阅读秩序；随后由主题派生的巨大扁平插画突然闯入版心和栏间，几枚不规则圆形、长条形或叶片状轮廓以天真尺度压过文字，边缘略有套印偏移和纸面吸墨，简化到只有清楚外形、少量线条和成对小圆眼，让严肃报纸变成亲近的公共告示。核心标题使用厚重黑色明朝感字形，字距紧、行距稳，放在插画下方或旁侧形成强烈停顿；小标题和正文保持真实报刊的高密度灰黑文本块，局部嵌入小幅纪实照片和细边框问答栏，但不要让照片夺走版心。色彩由主题自身派生，控制为新闻纸底色、黑灰文字、两到三种高饱和专色大块插画和少量低饱和辅助色：大色块明亮、干净但带印刷颗粒，局部露出纸纤维、轻微污点、折痕、扫描泛黄和墨色不均，旧化主要发生在纸张、黑字边缘和实色块内部，不做统一褐色脏化。版面允许拥挤、错落和轻微不对齐，保留儿童画般的圆眼幽默、地方新闻的朴素可信感、插画穿插文字造成的阅读中断；避免现代杂志留白、光滑矢量、商业摄影棚质感和过度精致排版。\n\n主题：城市+早安文化+2026-07-18\n\n————\n一共10个城市\n每个城市不同的配色逻辑+排版逻辑\n10个图片\n比例16:9","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/50906_out.png"]},{"i":4452,"text":"围绕任意主题对象构建亲密、带私人快照温度的时尚杂志封面。让主题核心以极近距离进入画面，尺度大胆，关键局部完整可辨，其余结构被边缘自然裁切；在前景一侧布置由主题语义派生的蓬松聚合形态或成组陪体，体量逼近核心并遮挡下部，形成近景涌来的丰盛触感。背景保持深暗、低细节，只露出少量环境轮廓，把视线锁在被光照亮的区域。顶部横跨一行超大高反差衬线刊头，细发丝与粗竖画反差鲜明，字面贴近边缘并少量出界，浅亮字形直接压在细碎轮廓、发丝或主题表面之上，局部遮住图像却保留识别焦点，使刊头同时承担尺度、框景与切片作用。沿一侧安排窄小无衬线短句和较大的两行标题，另一侧下方叠放紧密的小号衬线文案，底边再放轻松口吻的无衬线句子与简洁徽章；文字大小跨级强烈，既保留呼吸空白，也允许略微随性、接近个人拼贴的对齐偏差，全部文字由当前主题生成，不沿用现成品牌与文案。光线使用侧上方斜射的偏硬日光，让一道清晰阴影切过焦点，亮部大幅抬升并轻微溢光，暗部深而干净，细丝、半透明边缘和浅色材质出现柔亮轮廓；主题核心与前景占据主要明亮区域，深色环境退向边缘，形成高明度跨度和强烈明暗分区。色彩从主题情绪中派生：以大面积低饱和深色承托空间，以高明度浅色覆盖核心和前景，以少量较高饱和暖色落在最具情感的局部，并用极少冷色或中性色稳定层次；保持温暖、柔艳、洁净的综合色感，不锁定具体色名。质感采用清晰数码摄影与轻微即时快照处理，保留高光溢出、局部锐化和自然细节起伏，避免纸张老化、脏污颗粒与电影式厚重调色。最终阅读顺序先被巨幅刊头截住，再进入明亮主题焦点，随后落到前景聚合形态和边缘文案；若刊头不再压住图像、前景体量过小或背景变亮变杂，整体张力即失效。\n\n——————\n人物方向：春日花束肖像+浅发造型+近距离时尚特写\n封面用途：个人写真杂志封面\n柔光配色：冷蓝+银灰+冰白+低饱和暗场\n主视觉构图：正面近距人像+左下大束白花遮挡+顶部刊头叠压+竖版 3:4","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/50900_out.png"]},{"i":4453,"text":"Create a high-quality anime-style illustration of a handsome young adult man with sharp, well-defined facial features, striking sapphire-blue eyes, a faint blush, and a subtle confident smirk. He has tousled medium-length blonde hair with soft waves and side-swept bangs, giving him an effortlessly elegant appearance.\nHe is dressed in a perfectly tailored formal black suit consisting of a fitted single-button jacket, matching black dress trousers, a charcoal-grey dress shirt, a black necktie, and a neatly folded black pocket square. His outfit is sleek, modern, and luxurious.\nHe stands in a relaxed yet confident pose with both hands casually in his pockets. The composition is a three-quarter view, with him looking back over his shoulder toward the viewer, creating a cinematic and dynamic perspective.\nLuxury fashion editorial magazine cover setting, minimalist studio backdrop, polished marble accents, soft cinematic lighting, balanced negative space, premium high-fashion aesthetic.\nRender the artwork in a polished modern anime style with clean linework, expressive eyes, realistic fabric textures, dramatic lighting, intricate details, and a premium, high-end illustration quality reminiscent of a theatrical key visual.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/50817_out.png"]},{"i":4454,"text":"An adult young woman photographed in a lush outdoor garden, wearing a red-and-white vintage athletic set. She leans slightly toward the camera and holds calm, restrained eye contact with a subtle playful undertone. Preserve the reference image's delicate facial proportions, natural body shape, and small asymmetries rather than turning her into a generic, over-beautified social-media face.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/50577_out.png"]},{"i":4455,"text":"Hinata Hyuga from Naruto,\nanime character inspired Chinese ink painting portrait.\n\nCharacter must remain recognizable:\ndark blue long hair,\ngentle expression,\npale lavender eyes,\nsoft and elegant personality.\n\nStyle:\nChinese freehand ink painting,\nlight splash ink,\n焦墨飞白,\nminimal blue and vermilion accents.\n\nTheme:\na gentle oriental martial fairy standing among mountains.\n\nCostume:\nHyuga clan elements transformed into elegant Chinese martial hanfu,\nwhite and blue silk,\njade accessories,\nflowing sleeves,\ntraditional embroidery.\n\nComposition:\nvertical 9:16,\nhuge white space,\nmisty mountains,\nink clouds surrounding the figure.\n\nPose:\nsoft martial arts stance,\nhands forming elegant movement,\ncalm expression.\n\nAtmosphere:\npeaceful,\npure,\nprotective,\nmoonlight feeling.\n\nColor:\nwhite,\nblue,\nlight ink gray.\n\nNo photography,\nno realistic cosplay,\nno modern background.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/50568_out.png"]},{"i":4456,"text":"(Drawn in the art style of Jujutsu Kaisen Season 2 by Mappa Studios), (embedding:lazypos), (white background, bright backlight), blurry background, bokeh, floating red particles,\n\n1boy, (young man, white hair, layered hairstyle, short hair, glowing bright blue eyes, sharp eyes, amused expression:0.95),\n\n(Black button-up shirt, folded sleeves, charging red destruction attack on right hand finger:0.97), (tall, muscular physique, broad shoulders, wide chest),\n\n(cool red lighting, dramatic rim lighting, strong backlighting, ethereal atmosphere:1.1), light particles, red crystal shards","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/50558_out.png"]},{"i":4457,"text":"(My Hero Academia art style), (embedding:lazypos), (white background, bright backlight), blurry background, bokeh, floating yellow particles,\n\n1girl, (Nejire Hado, expressive blue eyes, amused expression:0.95),\n\n(Hero Outfit, hands emitting waves:0.95), (big chest, hourglass figure, athletic),\n\n(cool yellow lighting, dramatic rim lighting, strong backlighting, ethereal atmosphere:1.1), (floating in the air:0.7), light particles, yellow crystal shards, 2:3 ratio","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/50550_out.png"]},{"i":4458,"text":"Use the reference face exactly. Preserve facial identity, facial proportions, hairstyle, skin tone, age, and every recognizable feature. Create an ultra-realistic luxury editorial magazine cover inspired by Japanese summer films. The viewer stands outside a rain-free window, looking through the glass at a handsome young man sitting close to the windowsill. Close-up portrait (face fills 65–70% of the frame), slightly high angle. He gently rests his chin on folded arms, first gazing peacefully outside before naturally meeting the camera with a genuine, heartwarming smile, as if welcoming someone he has been waiting for.\n\nHis expressive eyes are the main focus. Soft golden summer afternoon sunlight wraps around his face with realistic natural shadows. The glass shows delicate reflections of lush green trees, blue sky, and tiny light sparkles without hiding his face. Warm ivory, cream, olive-green, and pastel tones, authentic skin texture, subtle cinematic film grain, soft contrast, creamy shallow depth of field, quiet nostalgic atmosphere, premium lifestyle photography. Clean minimalist luxury magazine cover with elegant serif title \"The Moment\" at the top-left and a refined subtitle beneath, generous negative space, award-winning composition, photorealistic, cinematic, 8K quality, 3:4 aspect ratio.\n\nAvoid AI-looking skin, altered facial features, exaggerated eyes, HDR, oversaturation, heavy bokeh, strong lens flare, cluttered backgrounds, or reflections covering the face.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/50469_out.png"]},{"i":4459,"text":"Low-angle editorial portrait of an adult Chinese woman in her mid-20s, smooth pale skin, delicate oval face, dark expressive eyes, soft matte rose-red lips, delicate lashes, elegant collarbones, and long silky black hair, looking up and to the side with a serene, confident expression. The people wears a shirt slouchy. Shot from below among tall wildflowers and green foliage, blue sky peeking through. Bold mustard-yellow serif type overlays the image — 'SEAN AIGI' above, 'Show Yourself' below — in a high-contrast vintage fashion-magazine font, cropped to bleed off the frame. Warm earthy palette. Natural sunlit lighting, shallow depth of field, film grain, editorial fashion style.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/50467_out.png"]},{"i":4460,"text":"刻晴 × 神里绫华《月下茶会》\n通用摄影基底：\n两位成年东亚女性，米哈游角色真人COS，高级写实电影摄影。\n保留角色核心识别元素：发色、瞳色、服装符号、武器元素、人物气质。\n重新设计为中国古典幻想高级定制服装，融合丝绸、刺绣、金线、玉饰、流苏。\n\n场景：古代宫殿、闺阁、庭院、书房、古宅、雨夜街巷。\n摄影：cinematic movie poster, realistic cosplay photography,\nJapanese photobook aesthetic, Ricoh GR III HDF style,\n35mm lens, soft highlight bloom, natural skin texture,\nlow key warm lighting, deep shadows, film grain,\nvintage Chinese cinema color grading, vertical 9:16.\n\n关系电影叙事设计：\n月光茶室品茶，屏风茶具，贵族知己感。\nNegative\nanime style, 3D render, CGI, plastic skin, fake face, modern clothes, modern room, studio flash, bad anatomy, extra fingers, low quality.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49842_out.png"]},{"i":4461,"text":"通用摄影基底：\n两位成年东亚女性，米哈游角色真人COS，高级写实电影摄影。\n保留角色核心识别元素：发色、瞳色、服装符号、武器元素、人物气质。\n重新设计为中国古典幻想高级定制服装，融合丝绸、刺绣、金线、玉饰、流苏。\n\n场景：古代宫殿、闺阁、庭院、书房、古宅、雨夜街巷。\n摄影：cinematic movie poster, realistic cosplay photography,\nJapanese photobook aesthetic, Ricoh GR III HDF style,\n35mm lens, soft highlight bloom, natural skin texture,\nlow key warm lighting, deep shadows, film grain,\nvintage Chinese cinema color grading, vertical 9:16.\n\n关系电影叙事设计：\n古风房间融合未来机械，一人持花一人维修设备。\nNegative\nanime style, 3D render, CGI, plastic skin, fake face, modern clothes, modern room, studio flash, bad anatomy, extra fingers, low quality.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49840_out.png"]},{"i":4462,"text":"通用摄影基底：\n两位成年东亚女性，米哈游角色真人COS，高级写实电影摄影。\n保留角色核心识别元素：发色、瞳色、服装符号、武器元素、人物气质。\n重新设计为中国古典幻想高级定制服装，融合丝绸、刺绣、金线、玉饰、流苏。\n\n场景：古代宫殿、闺阁、庭院、书房、古宅、雨夜街巷。\n摄影：cinematic movie poster, realistic cosplay photography,\nJapanese photobook aesthetic, Ricoh GR III HDF style,\n35mm lens, soft highlight bloom, natural skin texture,\nlow key warm lighting, deep shadows, film grain,\nvintage Chinese cinema color grading, vertical 9:16.\n\n关系电影叙事设计：\n雪夜居所披衣动作，冰蓝白色调，姐妹守护。\nNegative\nanime style, 3D render, CGI, plastic skin, fake face, modern clothes, modern room, studio flash, bad anatomy, extra fingers, low quality.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49839_out.png"]},{"i":4463,"text":"Create a photorealistic 2×2 character-editorial collage in an approximately 3:4 vertical format. Every panel must feature the same clearly adult woman, visually around 22 to 28 years old, with consistent facial structure, makeup, hair color, maid costume and headwear. Do not merge the four images into one continuous scene.\n\nShe has a compact oval face, a narrow jaw and prominently doll-like eye proportions. Her makeup combines Japanese gothic-lolita portraiture, doll-inspired editorials and Korean social-media beauty styling: a pale semi-matte base, fine natural brows, gray-green or cool-gray enlarging contacts, elongated black eyeliner, clearly separated upper and lower lashes, soft pink shading beneath the eyes, a few tiny freckle-like or beauty-mark dots, a gentle nose-tip highlight and muted gray-pink nude lips. Her lips remain slightly parted without a smile. In the upper-left close-up, she opens her eyes wide and looks directly into the lens. In the other panels, her eyelids are more relaxed or her gaze shifts slightly sideways. The overall expression should feel quiet, detached and self-possessed, like an ornate doll that has developed a will of its own.\n\nHer hair is deep chestnut brown, reflecting warm chocolate-brown satin highlights under direct flash. It is long enough to reach the chest or waist and paired with a neat, softly airy blunt fringe. Preserve two curved face-framing sections, slightly inward-bending ends and loose natural arcs. Include a few flyaway hairs, the natural spread of hair in the reclining panel and small variations in fringe placement between photographs. Avoid a rigid wig texture or perfectly uniform styling.\n\nShe wears a vintage Japanese-inspired maid dress in deep navy and creamy white. The bodice has a square neckline, a white apron panel, short navy puff sleeves, white eyelet-lace cuffs and dark satin bow details. The skirt is short and flared, with a layered white ruffled apron and lace petticoat. The lace appears light, thin and mildly translucent, with fine visible texture. The navy fabric is thicker and holds a structured bell-shaped silhouette. Add smoky-black sheer thigh-high stockings and glossy black platform Mary Jane heels. Her wide black-and-white maid headband is built from sculptural creamy ruffles, dark satin ribbons and large black bows on both sides.\n\nVisible skin includes the full face, neck, a small amount of collarbone, upper arms, forearms, hands and small areas of upper-thigh skin between the skirt and stockings. Her complexion is light neutral ivory with a subtle cool-pink undertone. Hard flash makes the skin appear creamy and bright, while shadowed areas shift toward soft gray-beige. The surface looks carefully made-up but still visually suggests a soft, fine, slightly cool and faintly powdery touch. Preserve natural joint color variation, subtle pores and small creases around the fingers, knees and arms. Avoid plastic or silicone-like skin.\n\nThe upper-left panel is a close bust portrait photographed near eye level. She looks directly into the camera and lightly touches the area beneath one eye or the cheek with a finger. Part of a black handgun-shaped theatrical prop enters from the side of the frame. The composition is tight, with the maid headpiece and hair filling the upper section and the square neckline and apron panel visible below.\n\nThe upper-right panel is a full-body pose seated in an ornate classical armchair. Her legs bend and overlap across the seat and foreground, clearly showing the sheer black stockings and platform heels. Both arms rise above her head, with a black handgun-shaped character prop in each hand. The arms form an imperfect triangular frame. The navy skirt and white lace spread outward, revealing rich layers of ruffles.\n\nThe lower-left panel is photographed directly from above. She lies on a brown floor with her head near the bottom edge of the panel. Her long hair spreads naturally like a fan. Do not rotate or correct this composition. Both hands hold a black handgun-shaped prop near the chest. The navy skirt and white lace gather above the body, while one bent leg enters the frame. Preserve a slight imbalance and spontaneous snapshot feeling.\n\nThe lower-right panel uses a three-quarter side view. She leans forward over a dark upright piano. One hand braces near the piano keys or casing, while the other lowers a black prop toward the floor. Her head turns back toward the camera. Long hair falls beside the face and along the back. The navy skirt forms a bell-shaped silhouette behind her, with the white lace hem remaining clearly visible.\n\nAll handgun-shaped objects must read as non-functional theatrical or cosplay props used only for fashion and suspense storytelling. Do not show real model markings, internal mechanics, firing procedures, muzzle flashes, shell casings, blood or injury. Do not point the props toward the viewer.\n\nThe setting is a dim and elaborate vintage music room, Victorian-inspired parlor or gothic private salon. Include a dark upright piano with visible keys, a carved wooden armchair with pale gray patterned upholstery, a vintage lamp with fringe or beaded trim, layered gray-brown and bronze satin drapes, a round carved side table, glasses, small bottles, a gold tray and a framed vintage butterfly-specimen display. The room should resemble a time-frozen antique dollhouse: refined, enclosed, quiet and faintly uncanny.\n\nPhotograph the collage like an early-2000s compact digital camera or early social-media character editorial. Use hard direct flash close to the lens axis. The face, white apron and lace become bright, while concentrated highlights appear across the nose bridge, under-eye area, backs of the hands, arms and thighs. Short, clearly edged shadows form beneath the fringe, chin, lace trim and skirt layers. The light falls off rapidly, pushing the piano, curtains, dark wood furniture and corners of the room into deep brown or black underexposure. Retain only weak warm tungsten light and bronze-gold environmental reflections. Do not add blue rim lighting, large softboxes or evenly balanced commercial fill.\n\nPreserve slight highlight bloom, dark-area noise, JPEG compression, uneven local sharpness, exposure variation and small white-balance differences between panels. The poses, stacked skirt layers, flyaway hairs and cropping do not need to be perfectly polished. She had already changed into the maid costume and entered the dim old music room. She now touches her cheek, raises both hands, lies beneath the camera and finally leans toward the piano. The next panel feels as though it might reveal the story hidden beneath the sweet styling. Blend Japanese gothic maid fashion, dark lolita, doll-like makeup, Victorian interiors and early digital direct-flash photography.\n\nNegative underage appearance, single image, incorrect collage, mirror selfie, phone covering face, extra person, inconsistent face across panels, changing hair color, changing costume, extra arms, extra fingers, deformed hands, broken joints, limb intersection, prop intersection, prop aimed at camera, firing action, muzzle flash, shell casings, blood, injury, explicit nudity, wardrobe malfunction, exaggerated bust, extreme tiny waist, plastic skin, waxy face, modern white studio, evenly diffused light, blue rim light, heavy HDR, oversharpening, noise-free commercial editorial, anime, obvious 3D render.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49637_out.png"]},{"i":4464,"text":"multiple people, dense scenery, eye-level portrait, telephoto, 3D render, vector, rainbow palette, ornate/script fonts, logos, watermarks, QR codes, heavy blur, malformed hands, illegible headline","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49616_out.png"]},{"i":4465,"text":"Use the reference person as the only identity benchmark and maintain a high degree of consistency in the five senses, face shape, eyes and overall temperament. An adult Asian woman with a clear and cold face, natural and delicate skin, long black hair was wet by rain, and the wet hair was cluttered on her cheeks and neck. She wore a slim black long-sleeved backless dress with minimalist silver earrings, thin necklace and rings.\n\nUrban viaduct scenes on rainy nights, wet roads, metal guardrails, distant high-rise buildings and traffic flow, street lights form a continuous warm yellow bokeh, and the ground reflects red, orange and cold blue lights. The characters are illuminated by warm color street lights and cool urban ambient light. The skin and wet hair have real water light, a strong sense of film, a shallow depth of field, a 35mm lens, slight film grains, high contrast but retaining dark details, real rain, real water droplets, fashionable photography of urban night scenes, emotional restraint, loneliness, ambiguity, and lasting for a long time.\n\nThe character looked back at the camera, his eyes were quiet and melancholy, and his lips were slightly parted, as if he had taken a last look before parting on a rainy night. The movements are natural, the shoulders and neck are relaxed, the body proportion is true, the hand structure is accurate, and the clap is not stiff.\n\nAdd advanced magazine-style English typography, use elegant high-contrast serif fonts, with separated word spacing, beige white and dark gold typography, the text is arranged in the negative space around the characters, not blocking the face, the typography is simple, breathable, and not messy.\n\nEnglish text:\n\nMIDNIGHT MEMORY\nI STILL REMEMBER\nA night that never left me.\n\nVertical version 3:4, single complete picture, no puzzles, no watermarks, no platform logo, no account text, and high-quality movie poster texture.\n\nFour action changes\n\nThe character was walking on the viaduct, facing forward, and suddenly looked back at the camera.\nThe character sat by the guardrail, looked up and closed his eyes, feeling the rain falling on his face.\nThe character is sitting in front of a bus or tram, with his hands naturally placed on his knees, and his side face looks into the distance.\nThe character held his face in one hand, his wet hair scattered on the side of his face, and stared at the camera up close.\n\nNegative prompt words\n\nLow definition, plastic skin, excessive dermabrasion, fake rain, cheap neon effects, exaggerated makeup, stiff movements, wrong fingers, extra arms, body deformation, inconsistent face, anime feel, excessive sharpening, messy background, text garbled, fonts blocking characters, watermarks, Logo, account information, puzzles.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49614_out.png"]},{"i":4466,"text":"Ultra-detailed 16:9 fantasy character design sheet, official AAA fantasy RPG character bible, clean editorial layout, elegant ivory parchment background with luxurious black and gold decorative borders.\n\nCharacter Name: \"NOCTIS\"\nTitle: \"The Eclipse Sovereign\"\nSubtitle: \"A mysterious royal guardian who walks between light and shadow, protecting forgotten kingdoms beneath the eternal eclipse.\"\n\nThe design is directly inspired by the uploaded reference image while preserving the same visual identity, facial structure, hairstyle, outfit silhouette, color scheme, regal presence, and overall aesthetic.\n\nLEFT PANEL\nFeatures a full-body hero illustration of a young royal guardian with messy medium-length black hair, sharp dark brown eyes, thick eyebrows, and a calm yet intimidating expression. His face is partially covered by an elegant black silk mask. He wears an elaborate black ceremonial royal robe with intricate metallic gold embroidery, luxurious layered fabrics, engraved golden trims, ornamental shoulder armor, gemstones, filigree decorations, chains, royal clasps, embroidered patterns, and high fantasy detailing exactly matching the reference aesthetic.\n\nHe wears an ornate black-and-gold celestial crown composed of intertwined golden branches, obsidian spikes, black gemstones, crystal ornaments, and delicate royal decorations. His posture is proud and confident with a noble presence.\n\nHe carries an elegant ceremonial sword with black steel and gold engravings (sheathed) while subtle floating golden particles and eclipse magic surround him.\n\nCENTER PANEL\nProfessional turnaround views:\n• Front\n• Side\n• Back\n\nPerfectly consistent anatomy, hairstyle, crown, mask, robe proportions, embroidery, armor pieces, accessories, and silhouette.\n\nRIGHT PANEL\n\nExpression Sheet:\n• Calm\n• Serious\n• Determined\n• Slight confident smile\n• Battle-ready\n\nClose-up detail panels showing:\n• Celestial Crown\n• Hair\n• Eyes\n• Black Mask\n• Royal Collar\n• Golden Embroidery\n• Shoulder Armor\n• Chest Ornaments\n• Fabric Patterns\n• Gloves\n• Boots\n• Sword Hilt\n\nAccessory breakdown:\n• Crown\n• Royal Mask\n• Ceremonial Sword\n• Chains\n• Gemstones\n• Decorative Clasps\n• Royal Emblems\n\nMaterial studies:\n• Matte black silk\n• Polished obsidian\n• Antique gold\n• Black velvet\n• Engraved metal\n• Crystal gemstones\n\nColor Palette:\n• Obsidian Black\n• Matte Black\n• Antique Gold\n• Dark Bronze\n• Gunmetal Gray\n• Ivory Highlights\n\nArt Style:\nOfficial fantasy RPG character sheet,\nAAA production-ready concept art,\npremium anime fantasy artbook illustration,\nWuthering Waves × Granblue Fantasy × Final Fantasy XVI × Black Myth: Wukong aesthetic,\nhigh-end character bible,\nluxury editorial layout,\nintricate royal embroidery,\nornamental fantasy costume,\ncinematic fantasy lighting,\nmasterpiece,\nbest quality,\nultra detailed,\n8K,\nsharp focus,\nclean composition,\nproduction-ready,\nno watermark,\nno logo,\nno extra limbs,\nno duplicated accessories,\nperfect anatomy,\nconsistent design across every panel.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/54854_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/54854_in0.png"]},{"i":4467,"text":"比例：9:16\n风格：Risograph孔版印刷 + 荧光叠色漏印 + 纸纹与套准微错位（印刷品插画，非照片、非刺绣工笔）\n主题：Frieren girls, assemble~ 孔版印刷海报——同一部作品四人\n人物形象须与其在原作动漫中的形象高度一致，关键发型/发色/五官气质/标志特征清晰可辨，避免换成认不出的路人脸。\n女性角色细节：韩系女神感，高亮牛奶肌，detailed skin texture & pores & moles，眼睛大而清透（叠色下仍开脸清楚）。\n人物（全部来自 葬送的芙莉莲，每张一个角色，明确成年，东亚审美）：芙莉莲（银发绿眼、旅人从容）\n服装：孔版荧光色旅装/法袍简化，清爽不色情\n构图：半身偏上，粗网点叠色，纸边毛糙\n约束：仅芙莉莲；强Risograph；可识别；禁止国旗/旭日；无大段可读文字","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/53681_out.png"]},{"i":4468,"text":"Ultra-premium automotive advertising poster on a dark cinematic background. A breathtaking exotic supercar dominates the center composition, photographed from a dramatic low-angle perspective. The vehicle features aggressive aerodynamic bodywork, glossy paint reflections, carbon fiber details, razor-sharp LED headlights, and ultra-detailed performance wheels.Massive bold typography reading \"UNLEASH\" spans across the background in oversized modern sans-serif lettering. In front of it, dynamic metallic chrome typography spells \"THE BEAST\", featuring reflective surfaces, futuristic styling, and luxury performance branding aesthetics.The supercar is illuminated by cinematic neon lighting with atmospheric fog, creating dramatic reflections across the body panels. Motion blur effects, glowing light trails, and subtle tire smoke add a sense of speed and power. The vehicle slightly overlaps the typography, creating depth and a premium editorial composition.Small luxury branding text above reads:\"PERFORMANCE REDEFINED\"Side captions include:\"ENGINEERED FOR SPEED\"\n\"LIMITLESS POWER\"\n\"LUXURY PERFORMANCE\"Large statement headline near the bottom:\"BORN TO DOMINATE\"Short slogan beneath:\"More than a machine. A statement of power, precision, and passion.\"Include subtle technical specifications, minimalist grid lines, crop marks, performance data graphics, racing-inspired symbols, and premium automotive editorial elements. Bottom branding area displays:\"DREAMLAB AUTOMOTIVE\"with a small production code beneath.Style combines luxury automotive advertising, modern editorial design, futuristic typography, premium sports car marketing, cinematic photography, high-end magazine cover aesthetics, hyper-realistic rendering, dramatic lighting, reflections, ultra-sharp details, professional graphic design, 8K resolution, print-ready quality.Color Palette:Matte black backgroundMetallic silver typographyElectric blue neon accentsCarbon fiber texturesGlossy reflectionsWhite LED highlightsKeywords:\nsupercar, luxury automotive, hypercar poster, sports car advertisement, cinematic lighting, futuristic typography, automotive branding, performance vehicle, premium marketing, magazine cover design, racing culture, luxury lifestyle, editorial poster, high-end automotive photography, 8K ultra realistic.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/52919_out.png"]},{"i":4469,"text":"'core_identity':\"Use the official character identity reference sheet and reference images as the definitive appearance source of the same person. Preserve identical facial identity, facial structure, cranial structure, facial proportions, eye shape, eye spacing, nose bridge, nose tip, lip shape, jawline, cheekbone structure, skin tone, body proportions, leg proportions, skeletal proportions, and overall recognizable visual identity. Maintain the exact same person across all camera angles, lighting conditions, poses, perspectives, and scene changes. Preserve the same anatomical structure and identity consistency without redesigning the face or body proportions. Allow hairstyle, hair color, makeup, styling, clothing, accessories, fashion details, and overall aesthetic styling to change freely according to the main prompt and scene context. Allow natural variation in facial expression, gaze, emotion, pose, atmosphere, cinematic mood, and visual tone according to the main prompt. If the main prompt contains emotional, cinematic, expressive, atmospheric, or stylistic instructions, prioritize dynamic natural performance while preserving the exact same identity. Avoid stiff facial expressions, frozen facial muscles, over-constrained posing, or template-like expressions. Maintain realistic facial flexibility, natural human movement, and organic emotional variation while keeping full identity consistency. 9:16 vertical composition.\"\n\n成像质感优先：全局低清柔焦泛朦，人物五官同样受到慢门横向重影与隔窗反射影响。冷调灰雾、慢门动态重影、低清胶片颗粒、低对比柔光，真人摄影、真实人物、实验性时尚人像。\n\nCreate one random images in a gloomy coquette style, with a dreamy melancholic, delicate, romantic, and slightly decadent atmosphere, the soft feminine fashion language of lace, bows, and revealing sheer tulle dresses: a girl standing at a city street intersection with strong, smooth long-exposure motion trails from passing cars and pedestrians, creating a lonely urban mood; she wears a light Y2K McBling outfit with an oversized jacket, rolled-up sleeves revealing slender pale wrists, layered bracelets and rings, black nails, light fishnet stockings, high-top boots, and a revealing sheer tulle dress with subtle bow details, holding an old toy, captured either in a side-glance turning-back moment or facing forward with windblown messy hair, in either half-body or full-body composition, with high-saturation image quality, subtle light leaks in the corners, iridescent effects, and a dusty worn vintage haze.\n\n避免高清锐利五官、强磨皮、暖黄调色、棚拍硬光","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/52913_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/52913_in0.png"]},{"i":4470,"text":"| 变量 | 填充值 || ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- || {{BRAND_TEAM}} | Dyson 马来西亚研发工程中心 || {{CREATIVE_AGENCIES}} | AKQA London, The Mill, Droga5 || {{PHOTOGRAPHER}} | 彼得·林德伯格 || {{PLATFORM}} | Instagram / 小红书 / 京东 || {{PRODUCT}} | Dyson V15s Detect Submarine 洗地吸尘器 || {{SPIRIT}} | 光尘猎手、科技洁癖、隐形战场 || {{CAMPAIGN_NAME}} | THE INVISIBLE HUNT. || {{ASPECT_RATIO}} | 4:5 竖版 || {{RESOLUTION}} | 8K 超高清 || {{STYLE_TAG}} | 科技极简家居摄影 || {{CATEGORY}} | 智能洗地吸尘器 || {{CORE_VALUES}} | 激光探测、光学除尘、干湿全能、科技洁癖、隐形清洁 || {{BRAND_TRUTH}} | V15s 不只是一台吸尘器，它是你与家中隐形灰尘之间的光学战争 || {{PSYCH_POSITION}} | 全球科技洁癖者的终极清洁武器 || {{COLORS}} | 科技灰、激光绿、纯净白 || {{LOCATION}} | 伦敦诺丁山极简公寓 || {{LOCATION_ELEMENTS}} | 白橡木地板\\n落地玻璃窗\\n晨光穿透\\n微尘在光束中舞蹈\\n极简家具轮廓\\n几何地毯纹理 || {{TIME_CONDITION}} | 周六早晨 9 点，阳光以 45° 角穿透落地窗，尘埃在光束中显形 || {{ATMOSPHERE}} | 静谧、科技、像进入一间被激光扫描过的无菌空间 || {{STORY_ACTION}} | 一次周末深度清洁的光学仪式 || {{STORY_STATE}} | 立在白橡木地板上，激光探测灯亮起，绿色光束照亮隐形灰尘 || {{STORY_DETAIL}} | 激光在地板上划出绿色网格，微尘颗粒在光束中如星尘般悬浮 || {{STORY_LIGHT}} | 晨光与激光探测光束交汇，在科技灰机身上形成冷冽高光 || {{STORY_MOOD}} | 像按下开关的那一瞬间，灰尘无处遁形，世界被重新定义干净 || {{STORY_INSERTION}} | 推动吸头，让激光把隐形战场变成可见的胜利 || {{TOP_ELEMENTS}} | Dyson 无叶标（极简）\\n大标题：THE INVISIBLE HUNT. || {{CENTER_COMPOSITION}} | V15s 占据约 55% 画面\\n正侧 15° 角度\\n极低机位，地板高度\\n激光光束作为引导线\\n落地玻璃窗晨光作为背景 || {{BOTTOM_PANEL}} | 极简规格面板：V15s Detect / 激光探测 / 洗地吸尘双模\\n小型行动号召：Start the Hunt →\\n瑞士网格对齐 || {{GRAPHIC_THEME}} | 激光网格、微尘粒子轨迹、清洁路径可视化、光学频谱 || {{GRAPHIC_INSPIRATION}} | 光学物理与微尘微观世界 || {{PRIMARY_COLORS}} | 科技灰、激光绿、纯净白 || {{SECONDARY_COLORS}} | 白橡木暖、窗光金、微尘银 || {{ACCENT_COLORS}} | 探测绿、尘粒金、吸头橙 || {{LIGHTING_TIME}} | 周六早晨光束时刻 || {{LIGHTING_FEATURES}} | 激光探测光束\\n晨光穿透\\n地板漫反射\\n机身材质哑光质感 || {{CAMERA_GEAR}} | Phase One XF IQ4 150MP\\nSchneider Kreuznach 80mm LS || {{CAMERA_POSITION}} | 贴地机位，地板高度 || {{CAMERA_REALISM}} | 中画幅真实感 / 超高动态范围 || {{ENVIRONMENT_REFLECTION}} | 地板激光光束反射\\n玻璃窗晨光折射 || {{COLOR_GRADE_STYLE}} | 科技极简家居 || {{COLOR_TONES}} | 科技灰基底\\n激光绿高光\\n纯净白\\n白橡木暖 || {{FILM_RESPONSE}} | ARRI Alexa 35 电影响应 || {{QUALITY_BRAND}} | Dyson |","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51542_out.png"]},{"i":4471,"text":"提示词：\n建筑摄影写实风格，岭南骑楼内部拱形走廊，连续的半圆形拱券结构，利用竹编工艺在拱廊之间搭建巨大的仿生装置，弯曲的竹篾和竹片编织成流动的有机曲面，形态模拟喀斯特溶洞岩壁与垂挂的石钟乳，疏密有致，竹面上留有天然的孔洞透光。自然天光从骑楼顶部洒落，在墙面上形成斑驳的竹影，超高清，8k，细节丰富的纹理，电影级光线，建筑空间摄影，广角透视","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51024_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/51024_in0.png"]},{"i":4472,"text":"EDITORIAL CONCEPTUAL POSTER — \"WHO SHOULD STEER THE SHIP?\" (9:16)\nMain Title\nWHO SHOULD STEER THE SHIP?\nSubtitle\n\nPlato's Critique of Democracy\nA visual interpretation of the Ship of State from The Republic (Book VI)\n\nOVERALL ART DIRECTION\n\nCreate a single-page editorial conceptual illustration inspired by the uploaded reference image.\n\nUse the reference only as the visual identity:\n\nconceptual magazine illustration\ncontemporary editorial illustration\nbold simplified geometric forms\norganic interlocking shapes\nlayered symbolic storytelling\nstrong figure-ground relationships\nplayful but sophisticated composition\nflat color planes\nclean negative space\nminimal but expressive facial features\ncontemporary publishing illustration\nhandcrafted print texture\nslightly imperfect screen-print appearance\n\nDo not copy the composition, colors, objects, typography, or layout from the reference.\n\nInstead, capture its graphic language and transform it into an entirely original philosophical editorial artwork.\n\nThe result should feel suitable for publications such as The New Yorker, The Atlantic, The Economist, or a museum philosophy exhibition.\n\nCORE CONCEPT\n\nThe entire page is one visual metaphor answering:\n\nWhy did Plato distrust democracy?\n\nThe composition should immediately communicate that the problem is not democracy itself, but placing power in the hands of people who lack the knowledge to govern wisely.\n\nEverything revolves around the famous Ship of State allegory.\n\nCENTRAL VISUAL\n\nInstead of a large isolated portrait,\n\nconstruct a giant symbolic Greek ship occupying almost the entire page.\n\nThe ship itself becomes the visual centerpiece.\n\nIts sail subtly forms the profile of Plato's face when viewed from a distance.\n\nThe hull, mast, ropes, and waves interlock into one conceptual composition.\n\nThe ship should feel monumental.\n\nNot historically accurate.\n\nInstead, it should be a symbolic editorial object.\n\nPLATO\n\nPlato appears only as\n\na beautifully illustrated head-and-chest Greek marble-like portrait\n\nemerging naturally from the ship itself.\n\nHis portrait is integrated into:\n\nthe sail\nthe mast\ncarved wooden ornament\n\nrather than floating independently.\n\nHe acts as the narrator rather than the hero.\n\nINTERACTIVE VISUAL FRAMES\n\nInstead of boxes,\n\ncreate five large symbolic editorial \"windows\"\n\nthat flow organically around the ship.\n\nEach window resembles an irregular sculpted fragment carved into the composition.\n\nEach one tells one chapter of Plato's argument.\n\nFRAME I\nTHE CROWD TAKES THE HELM\n\nIllustration\n\nMany sailors all reach for the same steering wheel.\n\nEvery hand pulls in a different direction.\n\nNo one looks toward the sea.\n\nThe wheel itself begins breaking apart.\n\nVisual metaphor:\n\nMany opinions.\n\nNo shared knowledge.\n\nCaption\n\nPower without understanding creates confusion.\n\nFRAME II\nTHE CAPTAIN CANNOT SEE\n\nIllustration\n\nA large aging captain.\n\nStrong.\n\nRespected.\n\nBut partially blind.\n\nUnable to navigate.\n\nOther sailors flatter him instead of helping him.\n\nVisual metaphor\n\nPublic opinion alone cannot determine truth.\n\nCaption\n\nAuthority without wisdom becomes vulnerable to persuasion.\n\nFRAME III\nTHE TRUE NAVIGATOR\n\nLargest frame.\n\nIllustration\n\nA calm navigator studies\n\nstars\nconstellations\nwinds\ngeometry\nsea currents\n\nwhile ignored by everyone else.\n\nHe never shouts.\n\nHe simply understands.\n\nThe sky becomes an abstract map of knowledge.\n\nCaption\n\nKnowledge is quieter than ambition.\n\nFRAME IV\nPOPULARITY IS NOT EXPERTISE\n\nIllustration\n\nSeveral sailors compete by\n\nmaking speeches\nwaving banners\npointing dramatically\n\nMeanwhile the ship quietly drifts toward dangerous rocks.\n\nThe rocks subtly resemble broken Greek columns.\n\nCaption\n\nWinning approval is different from knowing the right course.\n\nFRAME V\nWHO SHOULD GOVERN?\n\nIllustration\n\nThe steering wheel transforms into\n\na philosophical compass.\n\nOne path follows\n\nstars\ngeometry\nreason\n\nThe other follows\n\napplause\nnoise\ndisorder\n\nThe compass quietly points toward wisdom.\n\nCaption\n\nA city requires guidance just as a ship requires navigation.\n\nDECORATIVE LANGUAGE\n\nIntegrate throughout:\n\nGreek key patterns\nstylized waves\ncompass roses\nconstellations\nIonic capitals\nmarble textures\nolive branches\nrope patterns\ncircular navigation diagrams\ncarved medallions\ngeometric borders\nflowing banners\nscroll fragments\narchitectural silhouettes\n\nEverything should feel integrated rather than decorative.\n\nSTYLE LANGUAGE\n\nUse the uploaded reference as the defining visual identity.\n\nPreserve:\n\nbold editorial abstraction\noversized symbolic objects\ninterlocking organic forms\nsimplified faces\ncrisp flat colors\ncontemporary conceptual illustration\nasymmetrical but balanced composition\nlarge areas of negative space\nvisual metaphors replacing literal storytelling\nmagazine-cover quality composition\n\nAvoid:\n\nphotorealism\nAI painterly rendering\ncomic-book illustration\nfantasy art\nhyper-detailed historical reconstruction\ngeneric infographic boxes\nsymmetrical museum poster layouts\nCOLOR PALETTE\n\nUse six flat editorial inks:\n\nwarm ivory\ndeep navy\ncharcoal black\nGreek terracotta\nmuted olive green\nwarm ochre\n\nMaintain high graphic contrast with bold silhouettes and restrained color blocking.\n\nFINAL ART DIRECTION\n\nThe finished illustration should feel like a high-end conceptual editorial cover, where the title, imagery, and symbolism work together as a single visual argument. The uploaded reference should inform the graphic identity only—its simplified shapes, interlocking forms, flat color planes, editorial clarity, and conceptual storytelling—without copying its specific composition or subject matter.\n\nThe headline \"WHO SHOULD STEER THE SHIP?\" should function as the conceptual hook, immediately drawing the viewer into Plato's critique of democracy. The subtitle \"Plato's Critique of Democracy — A Visual Interpretation of the Ship of State\" grounds the historical context, while the five integrated visual frames progressively unfold the allegory through symbolic editorial illustration rather than conventional infographic panels. This creates a composition that is visually engaging, intellectually clear, and cohesive with the reference's contemporary editorial aesthetic while remaining entirely original.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49915_out.png","https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49915_in0.png"]},{"i":4473,"text":"(My Hero Academia art style), (embedding:lazypos), (white background, bright backlight), blurry background, bokeh, floating pink particles,\n\n1girl, (Ochacko Uraraka, exoressive bright brown eyes, amused expression:0.95),\n\n(Hero Outfit, hands spread wide:0.95), (big chest, hourglass figure, athletic),\n\n(cool pink lighting, dramatic rim lighting, strong backlighting, ethereal atmosphere:1.1), (floating in the air:0.7), light particles, pink crystal shards","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49589_out.png"]},{"i":4474,"text":"画幅比例： 9：16（竖屏构图）。人物居中偏下，顶部留白展现庄园树木。\n人物身份： 生成一张图片，主体是一位年轻的东亚女性。她是赛道上一名专业的赛车宝贝，气质兼具复古优雅与摩登活力，表情时刻挂着灿烂、开朗的笑容，眼神中透露出自信与对速度的热情，给人阳光健康、积极向上的感觉。\n服装细节： 身穿皮质复古赛车马甲与高腰白色阔腿裤，腰间随意系着一件红白格纹的野餐风衬衫。服装剪裁凸显运动曲线，上面印有做旧铜色复古车标和徽章，脚踩棕色粗跟马丁靴，整体造型充满张力与活力。\n外观特征： 人物拥有精致立体的东亚五官，深邃明亮的黑色眼眸带着笑意，肤色白皙透亮，在光线下呈现健康的光泽感。腿部线条修长笔直，肌肉紧实，展现出运动女性的力量美感。\n景别： 全身景（适配竖屏），脚下为草地，顶部为树冠与天空。\n构图角度： 正面，直击开朗笑容，身体轴线垂直。\n动作姿势： 弯腰拿着鸡毛掸子轻扫车身上的灰尘。\n固定场景： 拍摄地点为英国古德伍德复古赛车节的草坪上，背景里可见古典庄园建筑和停在草地上的各式经典老爷车，地面是修剪整齐的绿草和野花。\n固定光线： 使用上午十点的柔和暖色自然光，光线从人物左后方45度斜射下来，形成温暖的高光与柔和的过渡阴影，突显皮肤的白皙质感与服装材质的反光特性。","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49587_out.png"]},{"i":4475,"text":"Editorial fashion photography of a young East Asian woman with a serene expression, side profile, soft brown hair tied back in a loose bun with face-framing strands. She is wearing an off-the-shoulder mint green ribbed knit long-sleeve sweater, showing her collarbone, paired with a textured patterned skirt, seated on an ornate patterned rug. Captured on ARRI ALEXA 35, 50mm lens, f/2.0. Soft natural window light coming from the side, warm golden hour tones, chiaroscuro undertones, delicate skin texture, intimate and calm atmosphere, cinematic look, shallow depth of field, muted color palette, Kodak Portra 400 film stock style.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49369_out.png"]},{"i":4476,"text":"Two adult East Asian women, realistic high-end cosplay photography.\n\nA cinematic Chinese ancient boudoir scene featuring two fantasy characters with a deep emotional relationship.\n\nPreserve character identity:\nhair color,\neye color,\nsignature costume elements,\naccessories and personality.\n\nRedesign their outfits into luxurious Chinese ancient fashion cosplay,\nsilk fabric,\ngold embroidery,\njade ornaments,\nmetal accessories,\nelegant hanfu-inspired design.\n\nThe two women are not posing for a photo,\nbut acting in a cinematic story scene.\n\nOne gently leaning on the other's shoulder,\none softly arranging the other's hair,\nsitting closely together,\nlooking into each other's eyes,\nresting head on lap,\ngentle hand interaction,\nsubtle emotional connection.\n\nAncient Chinese women's chamber,\nwooden furniture,\nbronze mirror,\nsilk curtains,\nembroidered folding screen,\npaper lantern,\nantique jewelry box,\nplum blossom painting,\nwarm candle light.\n\nCinematic Japanese photobook aesthetic,\nrealistic cosplay photography,\nRicoh GR III HDF style,\n35mm lens,\nsoft highlight bloom,\nnatural skin texture,\nrealistic makeup,\nshallow depth of field.\n\nLow key warm lighting,\ndeep shadows,\nsoft contrast,\nslightly faded film colors,\nsubtle red green color grading,\nvintage Chinese movie still atmosphere.\n\nForeground objects,\nmirror reflection,\ncurtain framing,\nlayered composition.\n\nUltra realistic,\nphotorealistic,\ncinematic,\n8k detail.\n\nVertical 9:16 composition.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49342_out.png"]},{"i":4477,"text":"[Car full description and movie-accurate details], three-quarter view, vector art style, clean bold lines with subtle gradients, lowered aggressive stance, detailed wheels and lights. Background solid [main car color] with soft glossy reflection on ground. Top center: [Brand] logo. Below logo: \"[Model Name]\" sleek modern font. Main car scaled huge dominating the frame, 16:9 aspect ratio, dynamic composition","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49276_out.png"]},{"i":4478,"text":"Create a photorealistic 2:3 vertical, full-body fashion portrait with a high-key white aesthetic and a subtle playful-comedy undertone. A clearly adult young woman, approximately 23 to 30 years old, stands inside a nearly pure-white seamless studio, white light-box environment, or in front of a floor-to-ceiling window completely washed out by strong backlight. Place her slightly low in the frame with extensive white negative space above her head, and include her entire body, shoes, handbag, and faint contact shadows on the floor.\n\nShe has a naturally soft facial structure, full straight bangs, and slim black rectangular glasses. Her very dark brown, nearly black hair is pulled back into a low ponytail, low bun, or loosely gathered style, with several small flyaways around the ears. Preserve her natural facial proportions, soft jawline, subtle asymmetry, and realistic eye size. Do not transform her into a celebrity or generic influencer. Use restrained urban office makeup: lightweight semi-matte foundation, softly straight brows, muted beige-brown eyeshadow, fine black eyeliner, natural lashes, an extremely subtle peach blush, and soft nude-pink lips. Retain mild under-eye shading, color variation beside the nose, and small areas of highlight bloom.\n\nHer upper body leans clearly forward and bends toward image-left. Her head lowers, while her hips shift slightly toward image-right. The arm on image-left rises toward her forehead, with the wrist near the brow and the palm turned outward, as though she is tired after work or momentarily shielding herself from the strong light. The arm on image-right hangs downward, holding both a small black object and the two long straps of a cat-face handbag. The leg on image-left bends slightly near the bag, while the leg on image-right stretches widely toward the lower-right corner with a straighter knee. Let the shoulders, waist, and legs form a continuous S-curve and strong diagonal lines. The pose should feel intentionally styled but preserve casual imperfections such as a bent wrist, nonparallel bag straps, and different foot angles.\n\nHer eyes are slightly narrowed behind the glasses, with the gaze directed downward or just below the lens. Her lips remain naturally parted, with a faint glimpse of the teeth, as though she had just sighed or murmured a tired complaint. The expression should feel exhausted, mildly dizzy, self-aware, and endearing rather than dramatically distressed.\n\nDress her in a fitted soft-white short-sleeve collared blouse with a broad collar, visible button placket, one chest patch pocket, and a tucked hem. Keep the chest fully covered with natural fabric tension and only restrained contour. The forward bend and side compression should create realistic diagonal pull lines, small folds, and light gathering around the waist. Pair the blouse with a high-waisted fitted black mini skirt ending on the upper thighs. The skirt should follow the waist and hips while retaining fabric thickness, slight tension, and minor creasing rather than looking like latex or seamless shapewear.\n\nPlace a black ID lanyard around her neck, ending in a rectangular black card holder that hangs over the white blouse. Add a small silver chain-style wristwatch on the wrist at image-right. In the lowered hand, include a large beige cat-face handbag with a horizontally rounded silhouette, dark-brown piping, small cat ears, circular eyes, a triangular nose, whiskers, and blush-like dot details. Two long thin handles descend from her hand, and the bag hangs in the lower-left part of the frame with its base nearly touching the floor.\n\nHer legs are bare from the mini-skirt hem to the tops of the feet, and she wears nude-pink or beige pointed low-cut pumps. Visible skin includes the face, ears, neck, a small collar area, both arms, hands, and both complete legs. The chest, abdomen, waist, hips, and buttocks remain covered. Use a light neutral-to-warm ivory skin tone lifted by the high-key white illumination, while preserving a faint rosy undertone on the arms and legs. The skin should look as though it would feel soft, clean, finely textured, and slightly cool to the touch. Keep the arms and legs smooth but preserve realistic knees, ankles, finger joints, subtle pores, and minor tonal differences. Avoid plastic or waxy skin.\n\nIlluminate the background with a very large white source pushed close to highlight clipping. Strong backlight should wrap around the hair, shoulders, arms, and outer edges of the legs, producing soft white bloom. Allow some thin hairs and portions of the white blouse edges to dissolve slightly into the background. Use weaker frontal fill from a reflector, large softbox, or computational-photography lift so that the face, clothing, and legs remain readable. Preserve only pale warm-gray shadows beneath the chin, along the inner arms, under the skirt hem, and between the separated legs. The floor should show little more than faint gray contact shadows and soft reflections. Do not use hard shadows, colorful neon, dark cinematic light, or an obvious professional rim-light setup.\n\nPhotograph the scene with the visual character of a smartphone main camera, lightweight mirrorless camera, or moderate portrait lens. Position the camera between waist and chest height, mostly level or with a very slight upward angle. Keep medium-to-deep focus so the glasses, blouse, ID lanyard, handbag design, wristwatch, and shoes remain recognizable. Add gentle digital diffusion, mild social-media compression, low contrast, highlight bloom, and slight loss of detail in the white blouse. Do not make the subject edges resemble a hard digital cutout. Preserve moderate background clipping and overexposure, since the white haze is part of the image identity.\n\nShe had just emerged from a long commute or an exhausting workday, and the cat-shaped bag was still hanging from her hand. A moment ago she had been rushing; now she pauses in the bright space and raises a hand to her forehead, wanting only one brief breath before continuing. The final feeling is tired, cute, lightly theatrical, and self-deprecating: a social-media fashion portrait combining office-uniform styling, glasses, a black mini skirt, a playful cat handbag, and an exaggerated but believable exhausted gesture.\n\nAvoid: underage or school-aged appearance, mirror selfie, celebrity replacement, missing glasses, missing lanyard, missing cat handbag, trousers, long skirts, exaggerated breasts, extreme waist-to-hip proportions, unnaturally long legs, increased nudity, plastic skin, waxy skin, excessive smoothing, deformed fingers, broken wrists, twisted ankles, malformed heels, disconnected straps, hard cutout edges, detailed office interiors, colorful neon, hard shadows, dark cinematic grading, CGI, text, watermarks, and logos.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49261_out.png"]},{"i":4479,"text":"Act as a senior art director from a global advertising agency specializing in premium logistics and transportation campaigns.\n\nCreate an ultra-premium social media campaign poster for DHL in vertical 4:5 format.\n\nOBJECTIVE:\nPosition DHL as the fastest and most reliable global logistics network, emphasizing speed, precision, and worldwide delivery capability.\n\nART DIRECTION:\nBold commercial energy.\nIndustrial precision.\nHigh-speed visual storytelling.\nClean but aggressive.\nPremium enterprise campaign.\nBehance front-page quality.\n\nBRAND LANGUAGE:\nHigh velocity.\nGlobal logistics.\nUrgent movement.\nOperational excellence.\nIndustrial precision.\n\nLAYOUT ENGINEERING:\nDynamic asymmetrical editorial composition.\nStrong diagonal visual flow.\nLarge premium negative space for headline.\nClear hierarchy between hero visual, supporting graphics, and CTA.\n\nVISUAL HIERARCHY:\nHero subject occupies 50 percent of composition.\nMotion elements occupy 30 percent.\nBranding and typography occupy 20 percent.\n\nHERO SUBJECT:\nA premium DHL cargo aircraft flying aggressively toward camera at dynamic 3/4 perspective, emerging from clouds with strong forward motion.\nVisible DHL branding on fuselage.\nAircraft feels dominant, fast, and powerful.\n\nSECONDARY ELEMENTS:\nDHL delivery truck,\nshipping containers,\ncargo pallets,\nsubtle world route lines,\nwarehouse infrastructure.\n\nUse sparingly to support scale without clutter.\n\nGEOMETRY BLOCK:\nBold diagonal graphic planes inspired by motion streaks and speed lanes.\nAngular yellow and red shapes cutting across composition.\nStrong directional energy.\n\nBACKGROUND:\nExpansive dramatic sky with cloud layers and atmospheric depth.\nSubtle world map grid integrated into background.\nMotion blur streaks emphasizing global movement.\n\nMOTION / ENERGY:\nExtreme speed visualization.\nHigh-velocity streak lines.\nDirectional motion blur.\nParticle trails.\nCompressed airflow around aircraft.\nVisual energy should feel fast and aggressive.\n\nLIGHTING:\nHigh-contrast commercial lighting.\nGolden sunlight breaking through clouds.\nStrong yellow rim lighting.\nSharp reflections on aircraft body.\nPremium HDR realism.\n\nCOLOR SYSTEM:\nStrict DHL palette.\n\nPrimary:\nDHL Yellow (#FFCC00)\n\nSecondary:\nDHL Red (#D40511)\n\nSupport:\nWhite\nBlack\n\nNo extra colors.\n\nTYPOGRAPHY SAFE ZONES:\nReserve large clean headline area in upper third.\nReserve CTA area near lower third.\nMaintain clean readable hierarchy.\n\nHEADLINE:\nDELIVERED AT SPEED\n\nSUBHEAD:\nGLOBAL SHIPPING. ZERO COMPROMISE.\n\nCTA:\nSHIP NOW\n\nCAMERA:\nCinematic aerial commercial photography\n70mm compression lens\nDynamic forward perspective\n\nPOST PROCESS:\nMicro contrast sharpening\nSubtle bloom\nPrint-quality finish\nPremium commercial polish\n\nQUALITY:\nHyper-realistic\nPhotorealistic commercial advertising\nPremium global campaign quality\nUltra-detailed\n8K UHD\n\nNEGATIVE:\nNo AI artifacts\nNo warped aircraft\nNo clutter\nNo broken text\nNo distorted perspective\nNo cheap stock-ad aesthetics","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/twitter/49251_out.png"]}];